m / worth celebration, all of them, as / far as I know, true! / With love from an old / friend on an historic occasion / Carlo / April 7, 1955 / New York. / This is an advance copy / [of] a book which will be / published May 5, 1955.|SColl abq : Signature on t.p. by Edward Lueders.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}